#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:11
msgid "Tier Annotation Convention"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:13
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:15
msgid ""
"Establish a consistent pattern for marking documentation content by "
"product tier (Enterprise, Advanced, Essentials) so readers can quickly "
"identify what applies to their license."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:17
msgid "Decision Needed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:19
msgid "Choose an annotation approach:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:21
msgid ""
"**RST admonitions** — Custom admonition like `.. tier:: Enterprise, "
"Advanced` rendered as a colored callout"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:22
msgid ""
"**Badge/role** — Inline RST role like `:tier:`Enterprise`` that renders "
"as a small label"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:23
msgid ""
"**Conditional content** — RST `only::` or `ifconfig::` directives that "
"show/hide content per build target"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:24
msgid "**Sidebar annotations** — Margin notes indicating tier availability"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:26
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:28
msgid "Must be scannable — readers should spot tier restrictions at a glance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:29
msgid "Must work in Sphinx/RST and render cleanly on ReadTheDocs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:30
msgid "Must not require separate builds per tier (single output)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:31
msgid "Should degrade gracefully to plain text (PDF export)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:33
msgid "Acceptance Criteria"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:35
msgid "[ ] Convention documented with examples"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:36
msgid "[ ] At least 2 approaches prototyped and compared"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:37
msgid "[ ] One approach selected and applied to a pilot section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/planning/features/docs-tier-annotation-convention/spec.md:38
